    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "A protective informant from Sikar provided an information disclosure to the National Testing Agency, exposing a breach that jeopardized the welfare of medical applicants. The receipt of this warning revealed how a scheduled examination had its integrity compromised, prompting the responsible administrative body to refer examination personnel to the investigative authority. This escalation led to the detention of individuals accused of harming students, including an educator who betrayed their trust, and the invalidation of a compromised test to protect examinees. A remedial examination was scheduled to repair the damage to hopeful students.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "how-3",
          "result-0",
          "result-2"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The agency tasked with examinations received a protective warning containing document evidence of a compromised exam process. This notification, supported by PDFs matching the chemistry paper, forced a referral to safeguard the process. The ensuing investigation by law enforcement resulted in accountability for those who harmed students' prospects. An exam whose integrity was questioned was cancelled, and a re-examination was scheduled to restore fairness for applicants, though it extended uncertainty for student applicants.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
        "fragments": [
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "result-1",
          "result-0",
          "result-2"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.72
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "Following an exposure of a breach that jeopardized examinee welfare, the testing organization initiated an investigation. Evidence of a compromised exam process led to the arrest of exam creators and translators under scrutiny. This law enforcement action was a consequence of the complaint about a compromised exam, which itself was an event outcome of the disclosure. The cancellation of the high-stakes medical pathway for students and the planned re-examination were steps taken to address the harm.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-3",
          "result-0",
          "result-2"
        ],
